WEBVTT

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.160
"Shinjuku Ward"

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.830
"Shinjuku Ward"

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.830
Shinjuku's west side.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:18.910
On the other side of the wall from
its well-ordered, well-lit streets

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.000
lies the chaos of the east.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
In the darkness of Kabukicho,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.160
where elephants roar to sound the time,

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.790
and villains and bratty kids
lurk in every shadow,

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.910
you'll find six detectives.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:31.410
Weirdos, freaks, bozos and fools to a man,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.040
"Sherlock Holmes"

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.040
Weirdos, freaks, bozos and fools to a man,

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:32.500
Weirdos, freaks, bozos and fools to a man,

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.040
"Fuyuto Kyogoku"

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.040
Weirdos, freaks, bozos and fools to a man,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:33.450
who knows what madness they'll bring with them.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.450
"Michel Belmont"

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.450
who knows what madness they'll bring with them.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.450
"Lucy Morstan"                         "Mary Morstan"

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.450
who knows what madness they'll bring with them.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.080
"Torataro Kobayashi"

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.080
Please enjoy this battle of wits between detectives.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.620
Please enjoy this battle of wits between detectives.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:47.580
I'm the only one who matters on the stage!

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.040
Got it?

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.620
Sheesh. You're on thin ice, okay?

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:59.790
If it weren't for me, you'd be nothing.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.450
You want to fight?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.950
Or maybe you want me
to shove my fist up your ass?

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.950
"The Water's Usually Hot"

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.830
"The Water's Usually Hot"

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.830
Come on, please!

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.160
It'd really help me out!

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.870
I'm a detective though!
I don't do other jobs!

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.910
Help the guy out.

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:52.830
You're not doing anything.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:54.750
Thanks, miss!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.910
Hey there!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.620
It's Torataro!

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:01.580
Buy us something to drink!

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.410
Get lost, kids.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.000
You're so stingy.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.040
Give me strawberry milk!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.790
A grown-up beer! Put it on my tab!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:11.580
Me, too!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.750
Right, right. Two non-alcoholic
beers, coming right up.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.660
Hey there.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.500
How'd finals go?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:20.830
Well...

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.790
Okay, I guess.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.790
Anyway, what's his problem?

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.250
A job.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:34.120
Some trouble with his neighbors.
They're being loud, supposedly.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.250
Oh.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.870
By the way, where's Sherlock?

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:40.080
You're curious, huh?

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.040
Sherlock- <i>san</i> !

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:53.500
Are you making a mess deliberately
'cause you know I'll clean it up?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.950
Hey! Are you listening?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.330
Huh? Why's it locked?

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.660
Hey there.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.200
What are you doing?

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.660
Well? Well?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.330
Is it going good?

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.410
You're living with Sherlock now, right?

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.250
You've got different beds.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.660
Wow, you're like a couple!

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:21.290
Are you washing your
underwear in the same load?

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.330
You're trying to get Sherlock to like you.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.120
That's not my goal...

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.250
I just want him to help me out...

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.660
That's not food for people.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:39.330
Well, hang in there, mister.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.830
Hey, Sherlock.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:45.200
I got some tickets for a bath called
"Eight Heavens" from Mrs. Hudson.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.580
Want to go?

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:57.410
There's a special performance
by Master Koyoru today, too.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:05:02.870
I thought it might be nice to see a <i>rakugo</i>
performance right after a bath...

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.410
Let's go.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.790
Bye...

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.910
Fool. You're coming, too.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.790
What did you want so bad that you
were willing to borrow money for it?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.540
A bunch of stuff.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.000
I've never been to a public bath before.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.660
Kyogoku- <i>san</i> told me that all kinds
of dangerous people go there,

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:34.750
and all kinds of naughty things can happen.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.870
Well, you'll just have to get used to it.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.540
Get used to it...

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:40.790
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.000
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.000
We're here.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.370
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.450
Come on, let's go.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.370
Welcome!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.200
It's like a theme park!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.250
What are you doing?

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.080
I was thirsty.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.910
You want some, too, right?

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:14.500
But why does this vending
machine only have milk?

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.540
You don't get it.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.950
You're not supposed to drink the milk
until after you're out of the bath.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.580
You're not?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.000
Everybody knows that, fool.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.290
Sherlock- <i>san</i> !

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.910
"Sha"

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.910
You forgot your swimsuit!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.660
Fool. You don't wear a swimsuit in the bath.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.200
It's hard to fit inside this.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.750
Fool, that's for washing! Not bathing!

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.330
"Cold Water Bath"

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.450
"Cold Water Bath"

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.450
It's a little too cold, don't you think?

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.620
Fool, that's the cold water bath.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:53.290
There's lots of complex rules
for public baths, aren't there?

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:55.700
Really, are you that dumb?

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.410
Here you go.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:07.750
Um, what's the deal between you two?

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:09.700
What's it to you?

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.790
I was just curious.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.660
Your ages are very different,

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.830
and you're not related to one another,
but James is here all the time...

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.040
He just barges in without being asked.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.040
That's mean.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.830
Don't say that.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.750
You know you like it.

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.500
A dog?

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:39.200
I guess you could say we're similar.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.290
Similar?

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.660
Jeez... Take your time!

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.580
A monkey?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:08:00.450
Don't your parents get mad
if you're out this late?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.620
Not really.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.330
My dad's busy working as a real estate agent,

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.750
and my mom comes home late.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.370
But my sister's pretty annoying about it.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.580
She says it's not fair that I get
to stay out when she doesn't.

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.080
A pheasant?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.410
Um...

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:21.450
Is it just me or are there some
weird people in this bath?

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.450
A peach!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.660
That's Momotaro's.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:34.830
Shit! The concert starts in 30 minutes!

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.330
Calm down.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.870
Who's that?

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.870
How can I calm down?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.620
The Momotaros.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.620
How can I calm down?

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.870
An indy band based out of Kabukicho.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.660
All the teenagers around here know them.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.080
Momotaro?

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.500
Hey, is something wrong?

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:53.950
"Pheasant - Band 'Momotaros' Bassist"

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.950
"Pheasant - Band 'Momotaros' Bassist"

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.950
Momotaro disappeared.

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.950
Are you sure he didn't just
get out of the bath ahead of you?

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.700
No, his clothes are still in his locker.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.830
Maybe he left without remembering
to put on his clothes?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:04.580
No way.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.250
He must have disappeared!

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.450
He was spirited away!

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:09.450
He's done for!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:09.870
"Dog - Band 'Momotaros' Guitarist"

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:09.870
He's done for!

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:12.080
"Dog - Band 'Momotaros' Guitarist"

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:12.080
Should we have them call off the concert?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.450
"Monkey - Band 'Momotaros' Drummer"
"Dog - Band 'Momotaros' Guitarist"

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.450
No way!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:18.370
Shall we help you look for them?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.540
Let's race to see who can find Momotaro first.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.370
Loser has to buy the others milk!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.040
This isn't a game!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.790
This is a big deal for us!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.040
Don't worry.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.540
He's a famous detective!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:35.200
"Sha"

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.160
Don't worry about a thing!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:49.040
We know you're in there, Takezo Yamaoka!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.290
He's probably not home!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.080
Stop bothering the neighbors!

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.160
No, this is the only way to get his attention.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.910
Come on out before I bust down your door!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.580
You don't take 'em off, huh?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.450
Hey, what are you doing?

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.790
Stop it, Sherlock!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.790
Hey, what are you doing?

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.700
So, can you tell us what happened?

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:16.000
We were taking a bath
and Momotaro disappeared!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:19.830
Maybe you forgot what he looks like
because he's always wearing a mask?

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:21.160
Of course not!

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.620
We've been in the same band for
ten years since we all came to Tokyo.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.290
The four of us all live in the same house.

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:30.450
Pheasant and I have
known him since day care.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.830
Who saw him last?

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:34.620
Me, maybe?

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:38.910
About 30 minutes ago,
I was in the outdoor bath,

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.000
and that's where I saw him.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.120
Where'd he go?

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.750
Peaches don't just disappear on their own.

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.290
Somebody must have eaten him in secret.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.200
I don't get it at all.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:54.620
Okay, tell us everything that
happened before you got here.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:57.700
But he disappeared after
we got into the bath.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.080
Just play along.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:02.540
Did anything strange
happen on your way here?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.040
Strange, huh?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:05.660
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:07.370
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:07.370
That Momotaro!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.410
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.410
He said he'd be here waiting for us,
but he's not even here!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:14.620
I got a message from him.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.160
He said he'd be late so go on without him.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:19.540
Fine.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.200
You're not coming?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.750
I'll wait for him.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.580
"Eight Heavens Bath"
Okay. Got it.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.830
Why'd you stay outside?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.750
Because...

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.910
I needed to talk to him.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.500
What?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.120
Who'd you punch?

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.750
Well...

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.410
What happened?

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.290
I got into an argument with
Momotaro this morning...

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:01.000
He'd always make adjustments
to the songs I wrote

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.450
so he could get a share of the royalties.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.790
I didn't care about the money,

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:09.410
but I didn't like the fact that
he kept messing with my music.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.790
Pheasant...

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.950
So that's what happened with the coffee?

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.200
Coffee?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:19.700
I heard a loud noise
so I went to the basement.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:20.830
And then...

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:24.950
There was nobody in the room,
but coffee was spilled all over the floor.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:27.080
It was your fault, huh?

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:29.870
I cleaned it up, so you'd better be grateful.

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:33.540
What?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:34.700
Nothing...

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:36.540
What happened next?

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.080
I wanted to talk to him before the concert.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.870
I apologize for hitting you.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:49.870
But I want to talk again about our music.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.500
Momotaro?

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:58.830
So I just headed into the bath with him,

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.500
and that's where I met up with the others.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.870
Did anything seem off?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.950
About Momotaro.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.700
That's right. He sure was quiet today.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.500
Well, we just had a big fight
where we hit each other.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.540
But even still...

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.290
He doesn't talk to me that much anyway.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.830
What did you think, Dog?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:22.200
I was in the sauna the whole time,
so I don't really know...

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.620
I see.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.200
You see? Did you figure something out?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:30.580
I don't think Momotaro ever even came here.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.950
I saw him in the baths.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:38.410
That wasn't him.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:41.620
Right, Sherlock?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:47.540
You haven't seen Momotaro and Dog
in the same place since you got here.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.040
Is that right?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:54.790
When Momotaro went into the bath,
Dog was in the sauna, I guess...

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:57.000
But can he prove that?

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.700
I...

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:02.750
If that's really true, at least one
person here should remember it.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.500
You don't exactly blend in with the crowd.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.080
But nobody did.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:15.250
Because you pretended to be Momotaro.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.450
You sure you couldn't mistake the two?

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.830
He never got a message from Momotaro.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:36.040
I bet if we looked inside this, we'd find
hairs from both Momotaro and Dog.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.040
You found me out!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.950
Momotaro and I were playing a prank.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:45.790
I'll go get him right now.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.080
We won't let you escape.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.910
What are you hiding?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.290
Dog, where is Momotaro?

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.120
Dog!

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:05.000
I killed him.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.540
You killed Momotaro?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:12.910
No, Dog is just addled from the heat!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:16.700
Let's calm down, okay?

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:19.290
The body's in our house...

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:23.450
Sorry, I broke down your door!

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.620
Hey, you can't come in without permission.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.950
No, you need to apologize at times like this.

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.370
What are you talking about?
Let's get out of here.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:34.040
Stop it! You're hurting me!

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.750
That hurt.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.870
You confessed to that pretty easily.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:48.120
There's no point in lying, I'm sure.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.620
Now call the police.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:52.700
Dog, why?

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:56.750
Hey, how'd you kill Momotaro?

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.700
Well...

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.950
Come on, tell me! Tell me!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.910
Moriarty, calm down!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.910
Come on, tell me! Tell me!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.250
You wanna fight?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.580
Asshole!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:22.870
No, I'm the one who killed Momotaro.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.950
What are you talking about? It was me!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.620
I don't understand!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.120
Explain!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.830
We've been waiting!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.250
Hey, what's the deal here?

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.660
We've got two guys
who say they're the murderer!

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.330
It's simple.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.790
One of them is lying.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.160
But why?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:05.370
Listen up. Before he came here,
Momotaro got smacked hard by Pheasant.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.660
He probably hit his head on
the way down or something.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:11.910
After Pheasant left, he died.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:16.660
But then why didn't Monkey see the body?

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.910
Because somebody hid it.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.450
Who?

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.000
Wow, you're dumb.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.120
Dog's the only guy left, right?

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.040
He hid the body but he
couldn't get rid of the blood.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.950
He spilled the coffee to hide it,

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.410
but Pheasant didn't remember spilling it...

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:35.540
And that's why he was so confused!

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:38.500
Dog wanted to hide the body
as fast as he could,

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.950
but he had a concert to go to,
and not much time.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:44.870
So he stripped off his clothes
so he could pretend to be Momotaro.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.750
But Pheasant killed him, right?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.910
Why do all that to protect him?

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:53.700
We can only guess, but I think--

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:57.330
I didn't want Pheasant's talent to be
lost because of something like this.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.120
For an asshole like Momotaro...

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.540
Dog...

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:10.410
I knew his talent more than anybody...

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:15.660
When we were little,
I used to be bullied all the time.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:19.200
Pheasant's songs were
the only good thing in my life.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.500
Dog...

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.120
He didn't mean to kill him.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:27.910
And Momotaro deserved to die anyway!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.120
So...

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.120
Enough...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.870
That's enough.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.660
Pheasant! I'm so sorry!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.660
What are you saying?

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.910
Thank you, Dog...

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:46.040
Dog! Pheasant!

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.660
It's okay!

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:51.700
I know you two will
get a chance to start over!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:55.000
What the hell?

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.620
Is this worth crying over?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:04.750
How is being in a sauna like getting
ready for your first big rock concert?

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.450
I don't know, how?

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:09.290
They both get you really sweaty!

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.870
Well, we found Momotaro, I guess.

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:18.620
That was fun...

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.620
"Eight Heavens Bath"

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.000
Why'd they cancel the <i>rakugo</i> performance?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.700
Well, a man was murdered.

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.290
Why am I being arrested, too?

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.580
I can't get it off!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.580
Why am I being arrested, too?

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:43.200
Stop! Don't pull it off!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:51.200
Hey, why's Sherlock- <i>san</i>
so obsessed with <i>rakugo</i> ?

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:55.080
He wanted to be a <i>rakugo</i> performer.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.870
He still does, I guess.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.370
Really?

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:04.500
Yeah. But his master gave up on him, I hear.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:11.870
Actually, the first time I met him,
he was doing <i>rakugo</i> .

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:15.080
Wait... Wait!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:20.410
Walk a little slower, so I can keep up!

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:24.080
I'm in a hurry! A hurry!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:32.080
That's "Koheiji the Living," right?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.410
The tempo, the rhythm, the pauses...

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.790
You were doing Master
Koyoru's version, right?

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.950
Wow.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:48.910
You like <i>rakugo</i> then, huh?

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:51.200
Not really, but, well...

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:53.330
Just the stuff you cover in school, I guess.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:57.000
No, I think you two are friends
'cause you have something in common.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.200
We're not friends.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.790
Then what are you?

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.200
Best friends.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.200
Acquaintances.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.000
Don't blush.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:05.910
I'm not blushing.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.910
Friends forever, right?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:07.580
Die.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:07.580
Don't say that.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.290
"Eight Heavens Bath"
Die.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.290
Don't say that.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:13.370
"Eight Heavens Bath"I'll kill you.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:13.370
--We knew each other in our past lives.
--I get it! So that's enough.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.370
I had a good time today.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.250
And thanks for the milk.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.830
You return the bottles.

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.700
Everybody knows that, too.

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:25.290
No! Return it yourself!

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:29.660
Bye! Sherlock! Watson!

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.910
Okay... Bye...

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:36.870
Actually...

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:41.160
I remembered something.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.870
I found the body of a guy named Kintaro--

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:46.620
The killer was a black bear, right?

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.620
Distract them first!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:57.660
Distract them!

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:00.870
Don't look in their eyes!
Drop your hips lower!

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:03.450
Lower!

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:05.410
Lower! Lower!

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:08.580
Lower!

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:08.580
You're practicing pickpocketing again, huh?

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.250
Boss!

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.790
How'd it go with Watson?

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:14.330
What's the real deal with him?

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:17.250
Is he a spy? An assassin?

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:18.540
He's just a fool.

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:20.500
A wimp. A crybaby.

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:27.250
But, well, he's not a bad guy.

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:03.040
"Offside is the Best Side"

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:03.040
Thanks for always doing the cookin'.

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:04.950
"Offside is the Best Side"

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:04.950
Nah, it's nothin'!

00:24:04.950 --> 00:24:06.910
"The Top 2 Indy Bands on Shinjuku's East Side!"
"These are the bands the kids today listen to!"
"#1 Momotaros" "#2 Buri King"
